			"notes": "- Flint and Steel placed fire gets a seeded burn out time matching the vanilla burn out timing instead of almost burning out instantly\n- Pre-existing fires now fade randomly upon portal detection.\n- Fixed duplicate portal entries appearing when a portal is lit in debug.\n- The progress and attempt readout no longer shows when all nearby portals are already lit in debug."
